  "contracts": [
    "DeathBlowIntent inherits SingleAttackIntent and overrides only its presentation/IntentType; its numeric label still uses source attack damage hooks.",
    "GasBomb and WaterfallGiant are the only shipped monster DeathBlow constructors; both EXPLODE_MOVE bodies await DamageCmd.Attack then CreatureCmd.Kill(owner).",
    "Known current DeathBlow captures retain raw display type but normalize semantic attack features, raw base damage and a source-defined post-attack owner-kill marker.",
    "Native and imported potion timing uses canonical positive total intent damage independent of display enum spelling; it never multiplies that total by hit count again.",
    "All 121 monster C# files contain 333 balanced MoveState constructor sites and 217 attack-intent constructors (161 single,54multi,2DeathBlow); every attack-intent constructor belongs to a MoveState with at most one attack intent.",
    "MoveState.Intents has a private setter assigned from its constructor params; no monster intent-list mutations were found. Distinct simultaneous attack amounts are therefore rejected as defensive unsupported input, not an unimplemented shipped source move."
  ],
